# Defossilize: "target creature card from your graveyard". Bot2's Ornithopter, a creature card in Bot2's graveyard (its own Lightning Bolt killed it on turn 2), is no target, nor is the Black Lotus or the
# Dead Weight in Bot1's graveyard, which are no creature cards; the pool holds enough mana for the spell throughout, so each refusal is the target's. The Memnite in Bot1's own graveyard is. The Ornithopter stays
# in Bot2's graveyard. The two explores reveal two Forests, which go to the hand and put no counter on the Memnite (1/1).
